{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124374","id":4817711217,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHyhwcQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124374.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124374","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124374/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124374/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124374/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f5143367a32437be98a6271f6f51fd939de34507","number":124374,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Use the 2D default texture for unassigned samplerExternalOES uniforms in RD","user":{"login":"dcvz","id":2475932,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NzU5MzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2475932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz","html_url":"https://github.com/dcvz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dcvz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`MaterialStorage::MaterialData::get_default_texture_id()` in the RD renderers has no case for `TYPE_SAMPLEREXT`, so a `samplerExternalOES` uniform with no texture assigned gets an empty RID. `uniform_set_create()` fails on it, and every draw with that material errors and draws nothing:\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: Texture (binding: 1) should provide one ID referencing a texture (IDs provided: 0).\r\nERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (1) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\r\n```\r\n\r\nA `ColorRect` with this shader is enough to see it:\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nshader_type canvas_item;\r\n\r\nuniform samplerExternalOES external_texture;\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tCOLOR = texture(external_texture, UV);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nOn master (Metal, M1) the rect never shows up and the second error repeats every frame. With this PR it draws white, the same as an unassigned `sampler2D`.\r\n\r\nRD already compiles `samplerExternalOES` as `sampler2D`, so the 2D defaults are the right fit and the hints behave as they do for `sampler2D`. \r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nBuilt for Android and macOS and the unit tests pass.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"htt